	    <div class="fr-view">


        <p data-pasted="true"><b data-pasted="true" role="emphasis"><span style="font-size: 20px;">2026 General Election Constitutional Amendments</span></b></p><p data-pasted="true"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">The Lee County Supervisor of Elections gives notice that on Tuesday, November 3, 2026, three (3) State Constitutional Amendments will appear on the ballot, at which voters of the County will be asked if they approve or disapprove amending the Florida Constitution</span>.</p><p><span style="font-size: 18px;"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/1131" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 Constitutional Amendments (English PDF)</a></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-size: 18px;" data-pasted="true"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/1132" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">2026 Constitutional Amendments (Spanish PDF)</a></span></span></p>
    </div>

