					<ol class="tabbedWidgetNarrow cpTabs  accordion"  aria-hidden="False.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()" >
						<li class="" role="presentation">	<a href="#tab0e523ec0-0ff8-4a26-ba21-4d265fea500e_2" class="tabButton" id="tabBtnNarrow0e523ec0-0ff8-4a26-ba21-4d265fea500e_2" role="button" aria-controls="tab0e523ec0-0ff8-4a26-ba21-4d265fea500e_2" aria-expanded="false" ><span class="tabName editable" data-sequence="2" data-tabname="Town of Fort Myers Beach Town Charter Amendment Referendums" contenteditable="false">Town of Fort Myers Beach Town Charter Amendment Referendums</span></a>
</li>
					</ol>
				<div class="tabbedWidget cpTabPanel " style="display: none;" id="tab0e523ec0-0ff8-4a26-ba21-4d265fea500e_2" role="region" aria-labelledby="tabBtn0e523ec0-0ff8-4a26-ba21-4d265fea500e_2" >

<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditor0cb691d7-6c03-44a3-a0c5-b7282cd7a09c" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <p><strong><span style="font-size: 20px;">2026 Town of Fort Myers Beach Town Charter Amendment Referendums</span></strong></p><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;" data-pasted="true"><span style="font-size: 18px;">The Lee County Supervisor of Elections gives notice that on Tuesday, November 3, 2026,&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">the Town of Fort Myers Beach will place six (6) referendums on the ballot at which&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 18px;">voters of the</span><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">&nbsp;Town&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 18px;">will be asked if they approve or disapprove&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">amending the Town Charter</span><span style="font-size: 18px;">.</span><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">&nbsp;For more information, Town voters may contact the Town Clerk at 239-765-0202, Extension 1400, or&nbsp;<a href="https://www.fortmyersbeachfl.gov/m/directory/employee?eid=42" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.fortmyersbeachfl.gov/m/directory/employee?eid%3D42&source=gmail&ust=1788611517355000&usg=AOvVaw25XTO8lbnWc8-xmbUi5Nbg" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">email the Clerk</a>.<br></span><br><span style="font-size: 18px;" data-pasted="true"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/1086" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Ballot Language (English PDF)</a></span><br><span style="font-size: 18px;"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/1087" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Ballot Language (Spanish PDF)</a><br><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/1088" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Ordinance 26-08 (English / Spanish PDF)</a></span></div>
    </div>

