						<li class="" role="presentation">	<a href="#tab0e523ec0-0ff8-4a26-ba21-4d265fea500e_4" class="tabButton" id="tabBtnNarrow0e523ec0-0ff8-4a26-ba21-4d265fea500e_4" role="button" aria-controls="tab0e523ec0-0ff8-4a26-ba21-4d265fea500e_4" aria-expanded="false" ><span class="tabName editable" data-sequence="4" data-tabname="Fort Myers Beach / Iona-McGregor Fire District Referendum" contenteditable="false">Fort Myers Beach / Iona-McGregor Fire District Referendum</span></a>
</li>
					</ol>
				<div class="tabbedWidget cpTabPanel " style="display: none;" id="tab0e523ec0-0ff8-4a26-ba21-4d265fea500e_4" role="region" aria-labelledby="tabBtn0e523ec0-0ff8-4a26-ba21-4d265fea500e_4" >

<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditor764ff4e6-eff1-450a-87c9-d5ba0405938f" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <p><strong data-pasted="true"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Merger of Fort Myers Beach and Iona-McGregor Fire Control and Rescue Service Districts</span></strong><span style="font-size: 18px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><br></span><strong><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="color: rgb(192, 0, 0);">Florida Legislature Special District Referendum</span></span></strong></p><p data-pasted="true"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;" data-pasted="true">The Lee County Supervisor of Elections gives notice that on Tuesday, November 3, 2026, a Special Election will be conducted at which the voters of Lee County residing in the Iona-McGregor Fire Protection and Rescue Service District and the Fort Myers Beach Fire Control District will be asked if they approve or disapprove abolishing the Fort Myers Beach Fire Control District, providing for a transitional board, and transferring the assets and liabilities of the Fort Myers Beach Fire Control District to the Iona-McGregor Fire Protection and Rescue Service District.</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 18px;" data-pasted="true"><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/1093" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Ballot Language (English / Spanish PDF)</a><br><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/1094" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Laws of Florida 2026-192 (English PDF)</a><br><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/1095" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Laws of Florida 2026-192 (Spanish PDF)</a></span></p>
    </div>

